ation changes to font-face reftests because they only apply to Gecko 61+. a=expectation-revert", "files": ["layout/reftests/font-face/reftest.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2bc8c26c6a5ba3695eaf53b0fa5551cf313fc3cc", "parents": ["f643a88bac2fba398d63728faa55ed0251d94a74"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1513145 - Make some callers of TSFTextStore::Selection::GetWritingMode() check whether the selection has already been initialized. r=m_kato, a=RyanVM\n\nIf TSFTextStore fails to get selection, e.g., the content is really odd like\nfuzzing tests, its mSelectionForTSF is marked as dirty.  However, Windows may\ntry to retrieve writing mode while we're creating new TSFTextStore. Then, we\nmay hit MOZ_ASSERT(!mDirty) in TSFTextStore::Selection::GetWritingMode() in\ndebug build.\n\nSo, we need to make some callers of GetWritingMode() check whether selection\nis marked as dirty.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D14137", "files": ["widget/windows/TSFTextStore.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f55f68d6f5676a8c73d84105af6a8fb92763898e", "parents": ["2bc8c26c6a5ba3695eaf53b0fa5551cf313fc3cc"], "tags": []}], "date": 1549902458, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "324": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sebastian Hengst \u003carchaeopteryx@coole-files.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1522900 - Revert expectation changes to font-variations reftest because they only apply to Gecko 61+. a=expectation-revert", "files": ["layout/reftests/font-variations/reftest.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f49ec9a97e14dd3503aba21ffe956e742d48e3dc", "parents": ["f55f68d6f5676a8c73d84105af6a8fb92763898e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1549902758, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "325": {"changesets": [{"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozil